{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It\u2019s Wubbo, your new desktop buddy!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the PuterPal club and adopt your very own Wubbo friend who hangs out on your screen, going about their daily activities while you work, study, or browse the web. It\u2019s a fun little comrade to keep you company but also stays out of your way. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/6b7cce6d67489dae0daa6903b05c2b1c.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/6b7cce6d67489dae0daa6903b05c2b1c.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/6b7cce6d67489dae0daa6903b05c2b1c.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Wubbo has a lot of fun skills to develop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/559a1a20bb6b2cea7ebc1e4fc03f02ef.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/559a1a20bb6b2cea7ebc1e4fc03f02ef.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/559a1a20bb6b2cea7ebc1e4fc03f02ef.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each skill has its own activities and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a985d2409a0e5006a3f6b6751f877a35.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a985d2409a0e5006a3f6b6751f877a35.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a985d2409a0e5006a3f6b6751f877a35.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress continues even while you work,\u00a0Wubbo is your new co-worker bestie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/2888ed7e755b12bb220ea37ff12ce343.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/2888ed7e755b12bb220ea37ff12ce343.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/2888ed7e755b12bb220ea37ff12ce343.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on your own tasks as your Wubbo also progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a7036f6a1ef50a350b9adb4a11f862bd.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a7036f6a1ef50a350b9adb4a11f862bd.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a7036f6a1ef50a350b9adb4a11f862bd.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your Wubbo craft tools to unlock new skills and improve  efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/1b5cd7fa35412685f1882ac9848d2940.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/1b5cd7fa35412685f1882ac9848d2940.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/1b5cd7fa35412685f1882ac9848d2940.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize collected materials and resources to craft a diverse range of outfits and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match different dyed clothing items for various parts of the body (head, body, hands, and feet) to create unique and interesting outfits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new recipes, blueprints, special materials, etc by using earnings generated by your Wubbo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Care &amp; Feeding</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor  hunger and well-being. A Wubbo won't die, but may be less effective and happy when not taken care of.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your Wubbo happy and healthy by helping them prepare various foods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your hard-working Wubbo a nice bubble bath after all their hard work!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mail &amp; Rewards System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive periodic mail from interesting characters, including special reward deliveries from the PuterPal Club.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock surprising items and achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based and holiday themed rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adopt a Wubbo Today!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone who wants a low-maintenance virtual companion that adds life to their desktop experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Whether you're working, gaming, watching a movie, or just browsing, your charming Wubbo pal will be there\u2014quietly going about their business while you go about yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>F.A.Q</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Q</i></strong><i>: Can a Wubbo die?</i><br><i><strong>A</strong>: No, your Wubbo benefits from your maintenance and help but won\u2019t die, so don\u2019t stress!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Q</i></strong><i>: Can I display my Wubbo in my Twitch streams or other monetized online streams, videos, etc?</i><br><strong><i>A</i></strong><i>: Yes!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106310?t=1761701407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/85fbeaa40fb9e72edb1e31a294d0a0b8f3dc6a08/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761701407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/d5a11e8410ebebf80fa36add8edfc7bfdf75d27f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761701407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/d5a11e8410ebebf80fa36add8edfc7bfdf75d27f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761701407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It\u2019s Wubbo, your new desktop buddy!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the PuterPal club and adopt your very own Wubbo friend who hangs out on your screen, going about their daily activities while you work, study, or browse the web. It\u2019s a fun little comrade to keep you company but also stays out of your way. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/6b7cce6d67489dae0daa6903b05c2b1c.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/6b7cce6d67489dae0daa6903b05c2b1c.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/6b7cce6d67489dae0daa6903b05c2b1c.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Wubbo has a lot of fun skills to develop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/559a1a20bb6b2cea7ebc1e4fc03f02ef.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/559a1a20bb6b2cea7ebc1e4fc03f02ef.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/559a1a20bb6b2cea7ebc1e4fc03f02ef.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each skill has its own activities and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a985d2409a0e5006a3f6b6751f877a35.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a985d2409a0e5006a3f6b6751f877a35.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a985d2409a0e5006a3f6b6751f877a35.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress continues even while you work,\u00a0Wubbo is your new co-worker bestie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/2888ed7e755b12bb220ea37ff12ce343.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/2888ed7e755b12bb220ea37ff12ce343.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/2888ed7e755b12bb220ea37ff12ce343.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on your own tasks as your Wubbo also progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a7036f6a1ef50a350b9adb4a11f862bd.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a7036f6a1ef50a350b9adb4a11f862bd.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/a7036f6a1ef50a350b9adb4a11f862bd.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your Wubbo craft tools to unlock new skills and improve  efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/1b5cd7fa35412685f1882ac9848d2940.poster.avif?t=1761701407\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/1b5cd7fa35412685f1882ac9848d2940.webm?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/extras/1b5cd7fa35412685f1882ac9848d2940.mp4?t=1761701407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize collected materials and resources to craft a diverse range of outfits and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match different dyed clothing items for various parts of the body (head, body, hands, and feet) to create unique and interesting outfits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new recipes, blueprints, special materials, etc by using earnings generated by your Wubbo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Care &amp; Feeding</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor  hunger and well-being. A Wubbo won't die, but may be less effective and happy when not taken care of.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your Wubbo happy and healthy by helping them prepare various foods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your hard-working Wubbo a nice bubble bath after all their hard work!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mail &amp; Rewards System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive periodic mail from interesting characters, including special reward deliveries from the PuterPal Club.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock surprising items and achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based and holiday themed rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adopt a Wubbo Today!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone who wants a low-maintenance virtual companion that adds life to their desktop experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Whether you're working, gaming, watching a movie, or just browsing, your charming Wubbo pal will be there\u2014quietly going about their business while you go about yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>F.A.Q</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Q</i></strong><i>: Can a Wubbo die?</i><br><i><strong>A</strong>: No, your Wubbo benefits from your maintenance and help but won\u2019t die, so don\u2019t stress!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Q</i></strong><i>: Can I display my Wubbo in my Twitch streams or other monetized online streams, videos, etc?</i><br><strong><i>A</i></strong><i>: Yes!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["russpuppy"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106310/3690b25cc0be25a184819ef27bc2d98b8ea94d9b/header.jpg?t=1761701407","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Mi